MODELS (downloaded at runtime, NOT distributed with this application)
================================================================================

This app downloads TTS model files at runtime from Hugging Face. Model licenses vary.
The model repo IDs are defined in:

  TTSEval/Services/TTSModelCatalog.swift

Examples:
  - csukuangfj/kokoro-int8-multi-lang-v1_0
  - csukuangfj/vits-ljs
  - csukuangfj/matcha-icefall-en_US-ljspeech
  - k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx-models
  - csukuangfj/kitten-nano-en-v0_1-fp16

AVSpeechSynthesizer uses iOS system voices and does not download model files.

